4
00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:14,120
(Amy:)So, is that a yes?

5
00:00:14,189 --> 00:00:15,459
Not yet. I...

6
00:00:15,523 --> 00:00:18,563
(Sheldon:)How will I learn if
I'm comfortable living with Amy

7
00:00:18,626 --> 00:00:20,796
(Sheldon:)or just comfortable because
I'm in my own apartment?

8
00:00:20,862 --> 00:00:23,202
(Sheldon:)Now, if this experiment
is going to be valid,

9
00:00:23,264 --> 00:00:25,064
(Sheldon:)I suggest a neutral environment.

10
00:00:25,133 --> 00:00:26,403
(Penny:)Well, where would you go?

11
00:00:26,468 --> 00:00:27,768
(Sheldon:)Well, ideally, an enclosed,

12
00:00:27,836 --> 00:00:31,736
